  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Eight Heads — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have constructed a domain filled with your technique. The domain takes the form of grassy wetlands. At initiative 20, <em>Yamata no Orochi</em> forms from the earth. The shikigami does not take actions and does not have a turn in initiative. This is a false incarnation that only exists within your domain, containing the shackled mind of the original <em>Yamata no Orochi</em>.<br />\n On initiative 20 after <em>Yamata no Orochi</em> has formed, roll a 1d8. That number of creatures of your choice within the domain each suffer its bite. The shikigami disappears when your domain ends.</p>",
